  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1722030897_6533887_cee3b983ca1228703757f1710686a9e2.jpg",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">OnShelf </strong>is a semi-open online marketplace and curated edit shop, launched in 2020. We partner with <strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">over 300 studios</strong> worldwide and are now expanding collaborations with local artists to bring you truly unique pieces found only in specific regions.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\">Our mission is to make it easy to discover distinctive home and interior items from studios across the globe—offering the feel of neighborhood shopping, wherever you are.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\">From oriental to western, classic to contemporary, <strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">OnShelf </strong>offers a broad selection that blends global aesthetics with local charm. We believe your space should reflect your personality and values.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\">With weekly updates, we stay ahead of trends while drawing inspiration from local surroundings—constantly seeking pieces that spark creativity and originality.</p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\">Curate your space with OnShelf.</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(34,35,33);font-family:Poppins, sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"> </strong></p></div>",
